<main class="case-page"><a class="back-link" href="/#work">← ALL WORK</a><span class="eyebrow">CASE 02 / CLOUD ENGINEERING / 2026</span><h1>Smart employee<br/><em>onboarding.</em></h1><p class="case-lead">An event-driven employee onboarding and identity workflow built around AWS managed services.</p><div class="case-cover cover-blue"><div class="architecture-nodes"><span>API GATEWAY</span><i>→</i><span>LAMBDA</span><i>→</i><span>STEP FUNCTIONS</span><i>→</i><span>DYNAMODB</span></div></div><div class="case-meta"><div><span>ROLE</span><b>Cloud Engineering / Team project</b></div><div><span>STACK</span><b>Lambda · Cognito · Step Functions · DynamoDB · SES · S3</b></div><div><span>YEAR</span><b>2026</b></div></div><div class="case-content"><section><span class="eyebrow">01 / THE BRIEF</span><h2>Make onboarding<br/><em>less manual.</em></h2><p>Design a secure employee onboarding workflow that connects identity, workflow orchestration, notifications and employee records.</p></section><section><span class="eyebrow">02 / THE BUILD</span><h2>Managed services,<br/>clear boundaries.</h2><p>The solution uses API Gateway and Lambda for APIs, Cognito for identity, Step Functions for orchestration, DynamoDB for records, SES for email and S3 for documents. Work was split across service ownership with defined IAM boundaries.</p></section><section><span class="eyebrow">03 / STATUS</span><h2>Built with a team.</h2><p>Implemented the identity, workflow and API work packages. Full end-to-end deployment and final integration evidence are still being consolidated.</p></section></div><a class="case-repo" href="https://github.com/amit-cloudops-ai/hrms-onboarding-service" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">VIEW SOURCE REPOSITORY ↗</a></main>
